          <h2>About Me</h2>
          <p>
            I'm Brent Gabel, a Senior Software Engineer with over a decade of experience in software development, automation, and cloud infrastructure. 
            My journey in tech started with early explorations in ASP.NET, VBScript, PHP, and C++, building web applications and diving deep into database structuring and network architecture. 
            Over the years, I’ve evolved into a full-stack engineer with a strong focus on Azure-based architectures, microservices, and automation strategies.
          </p>
          <p>
            I thrive on solving complex problems and architecting scalable solutions. 
            Whether it’s designing cloud-native applications, implementing CI/CD pipelines, or optimizing high-performance systems, I enjoy bringing efficiency and innovation to every project I work on. 
            My experience spans .NET, C#, Azure, containerized deployments, and API-driven architectures, and I’m always eager to push the boundaries of modern software development.
          </p>
          <p>
            Beyond coding, I enjoy mentoring engineers, streamlining development workflows, and collaborating with teams to build high-quality software. 
            When I’m not writing code, you can find me exploring new advancements in cloud computing, testing out emerging DevOps tools, or refining system architectures for better performance.
          </p>
